# Path redirects, in the format both Cloudflare Pages and Netlify read from the
# published output directory. Host canonicalization (HTTP -> HTTPS, www -> apex)
# is NOT here: this file cannot match hostnames, so that stays in the hosting
# platform's own rules — see the README.
#
# The sitemap used to be a sitemap index at /sitemap-index.xml (@astrojs/sitemap)
# and is now the single /sitemap.xml. This keeps the old URL working for anything
# that already fetched it, instead of turning it into a 404.
/sitemap-index.xml  /sitemap.xml  301
/sitemap-0.xml      /sitemap.xml  301
